main.cpp
--cpp20 --object-bits 11 --no-unwinding-assertions
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ direct construction via union constructor: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ union copy construction: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ union copy assignment: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ wrapper engaged: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.5\] line \d+ union member constructed via union constructor: SUCCESS$
