--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
[class.union]/2: a union may have a user-declared constructor and is then
constructed via that constructor (not by conversion); its implicit copy
constructor and copy assignment copy the object representation
([class.copy.ctor]/14, [class.copy.assign]).  This is the storage shape of
std::optional/std::variant (a union with a constructor initialising one member).
